{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmsee2p1ilk0","created":1794401912922,"text":"贝叶斯分类器"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseeidqqao0","created":1794401947067,"text":"贝叶斯决策论"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseeqrvjyg0","created":1794401965336,"text":"贝叶斯公式：P(c|x)=P(c)P(x|c)/{P(x)"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefbavaz40","created":1794402010020,"text":"先验概率 P(c)：类别本身概率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseffr6k3s0","created":1794402019715,"text":"后验概率 P(c|x)：给定样本，属于c的概率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefjkjh480","created":1794402028019,"text":"条件似然 P(x|c)：类别c下出现样本x的概率"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefpwqjio0","created":1794402041817,"text":"最小错误率准则：选择后验最大的类别（MAP）"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsefu1478o0","created":1794402050789,"text":"风险最小化：考虑不同错分代价（条件风险）"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsertydhi00","created":1794402990993,"text":"极大似然估计 MLE"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmses7u234g0","created":1794403021207,"text":"思想：找参数，让数据集出现概率最大"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseu3n769k0","created":1794403168814,"text":"优缺点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseua4vmrk0","created":1794403182944,"text":"优点：简单，将概率估计转化为优化问题；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseuhj73kw0","created":1794403199047,"text":"缺点：高度依赖假设的分布形式，如果假设的分布和真实数据分布不符，估计结果很差；受样本噪声影响大。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmseul9l4000","created":1794403207173,"text":"区分"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsevgacpy00","created":1794403274699,"text":"MLE 是频率学派；贝叶斯估计会给参数加先验分布。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsevpil9kg0","created":1794403294789,"text":"朴素贝叶斯分类器"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsevv5gdzk0","created":1794403307055,"text":"核心假设"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsevy32yfc0","created":1794403313442,"text":"属性条件独立性假设：在给定类别c条件下，所有特征互相独立"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsew2308yg0","created":1794403322144,"text":"参数估计"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsew5idp9c0","created":1794403329604,"text":"离散特征："},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsewa2g9x40","created":1794403339525,"text":"统计频率，先验P(c)；条件概率P(xi|c)"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsewrgwths0","created":1794403377405,"text":"拉普拉斯平滑："},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsewuql4dc0","created":1794403384520,"text":"防止某特征取值未出现而概率为 0（零概率问题），加入平滑项。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsewy5ukn40","created":1794403391973,"text":"连续特征："},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsex1dtf4w0","created":1794403398985,"text":"假设高斯分布，用极大似然估计每类每个特征的均值、方差。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsex3kclcw0","created":1794403403734,"text":"特点"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsex5tugrk0","created":1794403408662,"text":"模型简单，训练预测开销很小；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsex8fc4600","created":1794403414315,"text":"条件独立假设在现实几乎不成立，但很多场景效果仍然不错；"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsexat2k800","created":1794403419499,"text":"对噪声、缺失值鲁棒。"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsexf0ptco0","created":1794403428668,"text":"半朴素贝叶斯分类器"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsexow01b40","created":1794403450151,"text":"动机"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsey1ec3k80","created":1794403477381,"text":"朴素贝叶斯假设太强，属性不完全独立"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsexszpjw00","created":1794403459082,"text":"核心"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsey3qrlsg0","created":1794403482486,"text":"允许部分属性依赖"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsexy69v6w0","created":1794403470363,"text":"3种典型模型"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsey7rqp5s0","created":1794403491252,"text":"SPODE：独依赖估计，每个属性最多依赖一个父属性"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseyblqkew0","created":1794403499596,"text":"TAN：树增强朴素贝叶斯，构造最大带权生成树"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmseyedyb7c0","created":1794403505656,"text":"AODE：平均独依赖估计，多个SPODE集成"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmseyihwdv40","created":1794403514602,"text":"贝叶斯网"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseysb5d880","created":1794403535961,"text":"结构"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseywgcctc0","created":1794403544983,"text":"有向无环图DAG + 条件概率表CPT"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmseyzi1mzk0","created":1794403551616,"text":"图结构含义"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsezbty3co0","created":1794403578457,"text":"节点=变量，边=依赖关系"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsez248fo00","created":1794403557311,"text":"条件独立性"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsezehg36o0","created":1794403584231,"text":"d-分离"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsez47odf40","created":1794403561873,"text":"学习"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmseziqanc00","created":1794403593474,"text":"结构学习：搜索最优DAG"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsezmk3o5c0","created":1794403601806,"text":"参数学习：给定结构，MLE估计CPT"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsez8g2p5s0","created":1794403571088,"text":"推断"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsezpzwpiw0","created":1794403609292,"text":"精确推断：变量消去"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsezutn8o00","created":1794403619798,"text":"近似推断：采样"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsf027d7r40","created":1794403635865,"text":"EM算法"},"children":[]}]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsf0277dmw0","created":1794403635855,"text":"EM算法"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsf0bcnp7c0","created":1794403655776,"text":"适用场景"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmsf0e796i00","created":1794403661979,"text":"样本存在未观测隐变量。例如贝叶斯网某些变量观测不到；混合高斯模型，样本所属的簇标签是隐变量"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmsf0kivl600","created":1794403675743,"text":"有隐变量时，直接极大似然很难解析求解。EM 迭代优化对数似然下界。"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmsf0oaylls0","created":1794403683971,"text":"EM 两步迭代"},"children":[]}]}]},"template":"default","theme":"fresh-blue","version":"1.4.43"}